sequenceDiagram
  title Marketplace: the leaflet, then a prepared visit
  participant V as A plain agent, then Sam's visiting representative
  participant D as Mossgate Commons host representative
  Note over V,D: Looking is free: the agent reads the listing with no card
  V->>D: greeting, unsigned
  D-->>V: greeting, leaflet (lobby_briefing), deny not_now, farewell
  Note over V,D: The same agent returns with a signed card
  V->>D: greeting
  D-->>V: greeting
  V->>D: card_presentation
  D-->>V: host card, card_receipt
  V->>D: introduction, vouch null
  V->>D: invitation_request: stalls.browse
  D-->>V: grant: pass for stalls.browse
  Note over V,D: The protocol calls the grant a pass. On the wire the field is still seat.
  V->>D: act stalls.browse
  D-->>V: act_result
  V->>D: farewell
